cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "vortex-cfd: Automated pulsatile CFD pipeline for intracranial aneurysm hemodynamics"
abstract: >-
  vortex-cfd generates complete OpenFOAM case directories from patient-derived STL
  geometries, runs pulsatile incompressible Navier-Stokes (pimpleFoam) over multiple
  cardiac cycles, and computes hemodynamic biomarkers (TAWSS, OSI, normalised WSS,
  sac pressure) scoped to the aneurysm dome.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Luz
    given-names: Diogo
    email: diogovluz@gmail.com
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-06-17"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Supperpt/vortex-cfd"
keywords:
  - computational fluid dynamics
  - OpenFOAM
  - intracranial aneurysm
  - hemodynamics
  - wall shear stress
  - oscillatory shear index
